# 统一换行符——四人 Windows/Mac 混用，不统一的话每个文件都会因 CRLF 产生假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做任何换行转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary

# 锁文件不参与 diff，只看是否有变更
package-lock.json -diff
pnpm-lock.yaml    -diff
